    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/0255b35294f8702cc756becaa2586105.avif?t=1752263089\" /></div><br><br>What Lies in the Multiverse is a story-driven puzzle platformer filled to the brim with hijinks, chaos, and reality-bending adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Seamless Transformations</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/d1eab5b786be268d2e4786af8f1809c2.poster.avif?t=1752263089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/d1eab5b786be268d2e4786af8f1809c2.webm?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/d1eab5b786be268d2e4786af8f1809c2.mp4?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Harness the power of the multiverse! Switch worlds in mid-air, turning pitfalls into bridges, walls into tunnels, and foes into friends. Just be careful when you mess around with gravity\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse World</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/8fea64b1168101c9a5a3ea65d809657a.poster.avif?t=1752263089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/8fea64b1168101c9a5a3ea65d809657a.webm?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/8fea64b1168101c9a5a3ea65d809657a.mp4?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Embark on a journey across gorgeous pixel-art worlds, each with a unique parallel reality you can dive into at will. Explore temples, towns, harbors, the wilderness and more as you race to unlock the secrets of the Multiverse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Colorful Cast of Characters</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/2a72a2a2d8778b08e26bf4bc4a4d60b5.poster.avif?t=1752263089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/2a72a2a2d8778b08e26bf4bc4a4d60b5.webm?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/2a72a2a2d8778b08e26bf4bc4a4d60b5.mp4?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Meet a vast cast of quirky characters: mad scientists, secret agents, sweet old ladies, enlightened monks, and a charismatic, reality-hopping genius named Everett, who promises to take you on a whirlwind adventure and is definitely telling you the whole truth about himself, yes siree, nothing suspicious there at all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Deeper Story</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/60a080decb4e1b0661098ff8f7b1abcb.poster.avif?t=1752263089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/60a080decb4e1b0661098ff8f7b1abcb.webm?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/60a080decb4e1b0661098ff8f7b1abcb.mp4?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A light-hearted but emotionally nuanced story that delves into the darker side of human nature. <br><br><i>\u201cOkay kid, time to go. You gave me enough trouble already and this whole mess won\u2019t fix itself\u2026\u201d</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/0255b35294f8702cc756becaa2586105.avif?t=1752263089\" /></div><br><br>What Lies in the Multiverse is a story-driven puzzle platformer filled to the brim with hijinks, chaos, and reality-bending adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Seamless Transformations</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/d1eab5b786be268d2e4786af8f1809c2.poster.avif?t=1752263089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/d1eab5b786be268d2e4786af8f1809c2.webm?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/d1eab5b786be268d2e4786af8f1809c2.mp4?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Harness the power of the multiverse! Switch worlds in mid-air, turning pitfalls into bridges, walls into tunnels, and foes into friends. Just be careful when you mess around with gravity\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse World</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/8fea64b1168101c9a5a3ea65d809657a.poster.avif?t=1752263089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/8fea64b1168101c9a5a3ea65d809657a.webm?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/8fea64b1168101c9a5a3ea65d809657a.mp4?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Embark on a journey across gorgeous pixel-art worlds, each with a unique parallel reality you can dive into at will. Explore temples, towns, harbors, the wilderness and more as you race to unlock the secrets of the Multiverse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Colorful Cast of Characters</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/2a72a2a2d8778b08e26bf4bc4a4d60b5.poster.avif?t=1752263089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/2a72a2a2d8778b08e26bf4bc4a4d60b5.webm?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/2a72a2a2d8778b08e26bf4bc4a4d60b5.mp4?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Meet a vast cast of quirky characters: mad scientists, secret agents, sweet old ladies, enlightened monks, and a charismatic, reality-hopping genius named Everett, who promises to take you on a whirlwind adventure and is definitely telling you the whole truth about himself, yes siree, nothing suspicious there at all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Deeper Story</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/60a080decb4e1b0661098ff8f7b1abcb.poster.avif?t=1752263089\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/60a080decb4e1b0661098ff8f7b1abcb.webm?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721170/extras/60a080decb4e1b0661098ff8f7b1abcb.mp4?t=1752263089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A light-hearted but emotionally nuanced story that delves into the darker side of human nature. <br><br><i>\u201cOkay kid, time to go. You gave me enough trouble already and this whole mess won\u2019t fix itself\u2026\u201d</i>",
    "short_description": "A bombastic puzzle platformer about worlds turned inside out. Shift dimensions at the push of a button, solve brain-twisting logistical riddles, and race through the wilds of the multiverse in a bleakly hilarious (and hilariously bleak) story where everything you know can turn on a dime.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain",
    "reviews": "\u201cOne of the best puzzle platformers I\u2019ve played in years\u201d<br>\u673a\u6838\uff08Gamecores\uff09<br><br>\u201cA wonderfully written story, combined with some dark, depressing and ultimately great side discoveries\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Finger Guns<br><br>\u201cGorgeous atmosphere you can't help but want to explore\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Shacknews<br>",
